  "historyNote": "#4060, eff 5-29-86, EXPIRED: 5-29-92 New. #5423, eff 6-23-92; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06 New. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
